# Retained evidence path budget: artifacts/ may contribute at most 1 MiB.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**
# Explicit path budget: 0 submitted bytes for each generated path below.
# Dependencies and bundler/package-manager caches, at every nesting level.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/.npm/
# Disposable local test tools, browser profiles, reports, and screenshots.
test/scratch/
# Production dist/ and its runtime assets are intentionally included.
